---
/** Landing page: 11. Final CTA (ported from indexreal.html). */
---
<section class="py-32 px-6 relative z-10 overflow-hidden border-t border-zinc-200 dark:border-white/5 transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="bg-[#d70c32] opacity-20 mix-blend-multiply absolute top-0 right-0 bottom-0 left-0"></div>
  <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mr-auto ml-auto relative">
    <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-6 transition-colors">
      Beidz Gaidīt.
      <br>
      Sāc Trenēties.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light transition-colors">
      Tikai 4 vietas atlikušas šajā mēnesī. Nodrošini savu nākotnes "Es"
      tagad.
    </p>

    <a href="#pricing" class="inline-block px-12 py-5 bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-lg hover:bg-[#d70c32] dark:hover:bg-[#d70c32] hover:text-white dark:hover:text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 shadow-2xl shadow-black/10 dark:shadow-white/10">
      Pieteikties
    </a>

    <div class="mt-8">
      <a href="mailto:info@akfitness.lv" class="text-zinc-500 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-widest hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">
        Vai raksti mums e-pastu
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
